        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC2202 Global Door Controls Interior Door Surface Mount Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC2202 Door Closer is an economically priced door \r\ncloser for use on interior doors in commercial and storefront applications. \r\nThey fit 7-3/8\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC2202 Door Closers are non handed and, for standard non-hold open applications. They can be \r\nmounted on regular and top jamb installations. An optional mounting bracket is available for parallel installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC2202 offering  spring power size 2  for use on doors up to 137 pounds.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 7-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 137 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 32\" interior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C (Fire test) Approved</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 2</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou can add an optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\">Parallel Arm Bracket PAB-2200</a> below if desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/glo-parallel-bracket.jpg?v=1704354576\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories and  Brackets\"></a>\r\n</p>",
